{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21489","headline":"荥阳郑公以稹寓居严茅有池塘之胜寄诗四首因有意献 · 元稹","name":"荥阳郑公以稹寓居严茅有池塘之胜寄诗四首因有意献","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"激射分流阔，湾环此地多。\n暂停随梗浪，犹阅败霜荷。\n恨阻还江势，思深到海波。\n自伤才畎浍，其奈赠珠何。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21489.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21489","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}